			<v n="1">answered Job out of the whirlwind and said:</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038002">
			</marker>
			<v n="2">without knowledge?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038003">
			</marker>
			<v n="3">I will question you, and you make it known to me.</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038004">
			</marker>
			<v n="4">Tell me, if you have understanding.</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038005">
			</marker>
			<v n="5">Or who stretched the line upon it?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038006">
			</marker>
			<v n="6">or who laid its cornerstone,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038007">
			</marker>
			<v n="7">shouted for joy?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038008">
			</marker>
			<v n="8">when it burst out from the womb,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038009">
			</marker>
			<v n="9">thick darkness its swaddling band,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038010">
			</marker>
			<v n="10">and set bars and doors,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038011">
			</marker>
			<v n="11">proud waves be stayed’?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038012">
			</marker>
			<v n="12">and caused the dawn to know its place,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038013">
			</marker>
			<v n="13">shaken out of it?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038014">
			</marker>
			<v n="14">and its features stand out like a garment.</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038015">
			</marker>
			<v n="15">their uplifted arm is broken.</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038016">
			</marker>
			<v n="16">or walked in the recesses of the deep?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038017">
			</marker>
			<v n="17">deep darkness?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038018">
			</marker>
			<v n="18">Declare, if you know all this.</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038019">
			</marker>
			<v n="19">and where is the place of darkness,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038020">
			</marker>
			<v n="20">the paths to its home?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038021">
			</marker>
			<v n="21">and the number of your days is great!</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038022">
			</marker>
			<v n="22">the storehouses of the hail,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038023">
			</marker>
			<v n="23">for the day of battle and war?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038024">
			</marker>
			<v n="24">or where the east wind is scattered upon the earth?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038025">
			</marker>
			<v n="25">a way for the thunderbolt,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038026">
			</marker>
			<v n="26">the desert in which there is no man,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038027">
			</marker>
			<v n="27">grass?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038028">
			</marker>
			<v n="28">or who has begotten the drops of dew?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038029">
			</marker>
			<v n="29">the frost of heaven?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038030">
			</marker>
			<v n="30">frozen.</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038031">
			</marker>
			<v n="31">Orion?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038032">
			</marker>
			<v n="32">the Bear with its children?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038033">
			</marker>
			<v n="33">Can you establish their rule on the earth?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038034">
			</marker>
			<v n="34">a flood of waters may cover you?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038035">
			</marker>
			<v n="35">and say to you, ‘Here we are’?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038036">
			</marker>
			<v n="36">or given understanding to the mind?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038037">
			</marker>
			<v n="37">Or who can tilt the waterskins of the heavens,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038038">
			</marker>
			<v n="38">the clods stick fast together?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038039">
			</marker>
			<v n="39">satisfy the appetite of the young lions,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038040">
			</marker>
			<v n="40">in their thicket?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038041">
			</marker>
			<v n="41">and wander about for lack of food?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18038042">
